vwGKQXsf&_nc_oc=AdnbhgRHqonfiHc2DAvDm17dV_KZn4WQ80btMJtr5naws9xBYjO9aodyeaN8i8UXun0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsR4hVf5R5miwo4qZF0OHwmlV1XceBfENQaYLNunjVdQA&oe=699EFED4"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "497880493079740", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392030_497880496413073_6685533152652071397_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ulZeT_SwaW0Q7kNvwHzGFo1&_nc_oc=Adnc8XNCq4IrOB-mdmZTo_wImqDumlkN-vI9cSEbZtzbf47t2uK95M54FQHEH0PZaFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsbyPhAkcLiD0CEoaySu3zezp5MkI0wmyNS2U_fW_vX7g&oe=699F084E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "spiderarttestTitle.png", "id": "1277705199969122", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397684_1277705203302455_7259243560357786598_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BBYm6I14XJwQ7kNvwFXvQQD&_nc_oc=AdlibPw-nZMSFbqpkVKdo0K80BVH3TXFg9l0m9eSnNRUSTIvNjUOgHsE0F5HW-VJ31w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvFF3icVkSQPDefvo6rebpGoyykp3EXhbzRCNep9cQX3g&oe=699EE558"}, "display_name": "Spiders", "keywords": ["Spiders", "hangout", "social", "multiplayer", "climbing"], "long_description": "Spiders is a social VR experience where you inhabit a colorful arachnid and climb around finding cocoons to deliver to a nest. \n\nYou can steal cocoons from other spiders to score points, and the first spider to 10 points wins the crown! It's a deceptively simple game that's easy to pick up and hard to master. \n\nIn Spiders you can : \n\n- be a Spider!\n- choose your color\n- deck out your Arachnid in special cosmetic gear\n- make new friends (and enemies!)\n\nWith social features and addictive gameplay, Spiders is a casual, fun hangout experience that can be taken seriously as you desire, or as chill as you want. ", "short_description": "Arachnid activities for your bug buddies. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soaringrocstudi